T1  - A technique for the rapid isolation and identification of psilocin from psilocin/psilocybin-containing mushrooms
A1  - Lee R.E. 
Y1  - 1985//
N2  - A method has been developed for the rapid isolation and identification of psilocin from psilocin/psilocybin-containing mushrooms. Based on the difference in the solubility properties in butyl chloride of psilocin and other constituents present in psilocin/psilocybin-containing mushrooms, psilocin was easily separated in pure form.
