2061. 
TY  - JOUR
ID  - 14238590
T1  - Indolamine hallucinogens as MAO inhibitor agents - Theoretical approach
A1  - Brandys Y.
A1  - Yehuda S. 
Y1  - 1983//
N2  - A new theoretical hypothesis on the mode of action of LSD and other hallucinogens of the indolamine family is proposed. In view of the suggestions that LSD acts both on the 5-HT system as an antagonist and on the DA system as an agonist, we suggest that in addition to 5-HT blocking capacity, LSD and the other indolamine hallucinogens act as MAO inhibitors.
