T1  - Identification of major drugs of abuse using chromatography: An update
A1  - Gough T.A.
A1  - Baker P.B. 
Y1  - 1983//
N2  - A review of the application of chromatography to the analysis of drugs of abuse was recently published covering the period up to 1980. The present review is intended to update the previous one and therefore covers only the most recent papers. The objectives are the same, and the review is presented in a similar format. Investigated drugs were: heroin and related narcotics; cocaine and other local anesthetics; lysergide and other hallucinogens; amphetamines and related stimulants; barbiturates and other hypnotics; phencyclidine and analogs and cannabis products.
