2079. 
TY  - JOUR
ID  - 13142533
T1  - Mushroom poisoning
A1  - Gibbons R.B. 
Y1  - 1982//
N2  - Identification and harvesting of wild mushrooms is a popular hobby of naturalists, experts, and novice hunters. Interest in the culinary and psychoactive properties of these fungi has created real and potential medical emergencies in areas where mushrooms grow readily. Physicians are not necessarily expert mycologists; however, when poisoning occurs, a few simple guidelines may aid correct diagnosis and proper therapy.
