2081. 
TY  - JOUR
ID  - 12053388
T1  - Intoxication by narcotic and non-narcotic drugs
T3  - AKUTE INTOXIKATION MIT DROGEN
A1  - Haas St.
A1  - Stober B. 
Y1  - 1982//
N2  - The increasing misuse of different psychotropic drugs means a socio-economic as well as a medical-pharmacological problem. The diagnosis of emergency cases of drug abuse, belonging to exogenous psychosis, is rather difficult in most cases because of the variety of psychopathological symptoms. In the beginning the treatment must exclusively depend on the symptoms. Diazepam has proved to be the drug of the first choice under emergency conditions. An additional dose of haloperidol might be dispensed in case of productive-psychotic symptoms. Beside the treatment with psychopharmacological drugs, psychotherapeutic and intensive medical methods and techniques should be used.
