2083. 
TY  - JOUR
ID  - 13212940
T1  - Clinical approach to mushroom poisoning
T3  - APPROCHE CLINIQUE DES INTOXICATIONS AUX CHAMPIGNONS
A1  - Askenasi R. 
Y1  - 1982//
N2  - Mushroom intoxication is rare in Belgium. Consequently, physicians do not know much about it. The purpose of the present article is to present a clinical approach allowing the diagnoses of the common intoxications. From the 'incubation' period, and the symptoms, it is possible to identify the toxin and to estimate the severity of the intoxication. A comprehensive treatment should follow.
