ID  - 11200741
T1  - Psychedelic drug-assisted psychotherapy with persons suffering from terminal cancer
A1  - Richards W.A. 
Y1  - 1980//
N2  - An overview of an experimental program of psychedelic drug-assisted psychotherapy for terminal cancer patients suffering from psychological distress is presented. Therapeutic procedures are described in detail. Discussion focuses on the categories of altered states of consciousness reported by patients and their respective import for psychotherapy.
