T1  - Eyesight and drugs
T3  - VISION Y DROGAS
A1  - Morales Stoppello J.
A1  - Del Carmen Vargas M. 
Y1  - 1979//
N2  - A study is presented on the different alterations of perception produced by various drugs. A review is made of the concepts of sensation, perception, illusion and hallucination and the work concludes with a schematic table which contrasts the visual hallucinations of drug addicts with those of alcoholics and schizophrenics.
