ID  - 9081708
T1  - Neurohumoral determinants of sensitivity to LSD
A1  - Appel J.B. 
Y1  - 1979//
N2  - The investigator is studying the relationship between the behavioral effects of hallucinogens such as LSD and the biological activity of chemically defined neuronal systems in the brain. Information obtained through this research may help to delineate the mechanism of action of these drugs and increase the understanding of clinical dysfunction, which the effects of LSD and other psychotomimetics resemble.
