2213. 
TY  - JOUR
ID  - 9041245
T1  - Reflections on LSD: Ten years later
A1  - Metzner R. 
Y1  - 1978//
N2  - The meditative and therapeutic techniques that many of the psychedelic voyagers have been exploring during the seventies, learning how to change consciousness constructively and creatively, can be and probably will be integrated and synthesized with the chemical tools. The drug experience can, if the set is oriented that way, open man's vision of his evolutionary potential. But the drug itself is not enough to bring about any kind of spiritual awakening. In synergic fashion, the transpersonal methods and practices can provide the means for the vision to be translated into the moving/living realities of everyday here/now.
