ID  - 6075459
T1  - Nonmedical use of drugs
T3  - L'USAGE NON MEDICAL DE DROGUES
A1  - Barker M. 
Y1  - 1975//
N2  - The author deals with the problem of the non medical use of drugs in the Montreal region during the year 1974: marijuana has become a political matter, hallucinogens, in 87% of cases, consist in phenylcyclohexylpiperidine (PCP), opiates are now very easy to get and the use of alcohol by young people has become alarming. The psychopharmacology of PCP and the treatment of its effects are fully discussed.
