2295. 
TY  - JOUR
ID  - 6128999
T1  - Selected bibliography on detection of dependence producing drugs in body fluids
A1  - Chrusciel T.L.
A1  - Chrusciel M. 
Y1  - 1975//
N2  - In the present bibliography an attempt has been made to select from the scientific literature and bibliographical compilations published or prepared since 1969 all references that relate directly to the detection of dependence producing drugs in body fluids and/or refer to technical problems connected with analytical methods used. Some references to articles dated earlier than 1969 describing methods that are considered to be still relevant have also been included. Every effort has been made to include all work published between 1969 and October 1974. The work is arranged under 11 main headings, a general section on methods of detection followed by sections covering the main groups of dependence producing drugs with subsections for individual drugs.
