2307. 
TY  - JOUR
ID  - 5165088
T1  - Covert drug abuse. Among young hospitalized psychiatric patients
A1  - Butzer S.C.
A1  - Cline D.W. 
Y1  - 1974//
N2  - A series of 50 psychiatric inpatients, ages 15-25 years, were studied regarding their illicit use of drugs for a period of one to 9 weeks. 14.4% of 153 urine samples were positive for barbiturates and/or amphetamines and 78% of the patients had used drugs before entering the hospital. A lower incidence of illicit drug use in hospitalized patients is related to the unit's therapeutic community program.
