T1  - The effect of LSD, psilocybin, harmaline and amphetamine on the body temperature of para chlorophenylalanine pretreated rabbits
A1  - Ladefoged O. 
Y1  - 1974//
N2  - Effects of the 4 psychopharmacologically active compounds on rectal temperature were examined in untreated and fenclonine (p chlorophenylalanine) pretreated rabbits. All 4 compounds caused hyperthermia. Fenclonine pretreatment antagonized the effects of amphetamine and harmaline but potentiated those of (LSD) lysergide and psilocybine.
