2327. 
TY  - JOUR
ID  - 5153968
T1  - The combined abuse of alcohol and amphetamines
A1  - Kipperman A.
A1  - Fine E.W. 
Y1  - 1974//
N2  - The authors interviewed 15 men who used both alcohol and amphetamines. The clinical histories indicated the existence of 2 types of abuse patterns, one primarily concerned with the effects of amphetamines and the other with the effects of alcohol. The authors discuss the similarities and differences between the 2 groups in terms of psychological test results and drug abuse histories. The management of this combination syndrome is different from that for separate alcohol and drug abuse syndromes.
