A1  - Snyder S.
A1  - Richelson E. 
Y1  - 1968//
N2  - A review on structure activity relationships of drugs is useful as a tool in determining their mode of action and facilitating the development of more potent agents. Among the psychedelic drugs of the mescaline, LSD, psilocybin class, there are some dramatic variations in potency with small changes in chemical structure.
