N2  - The convulsion-threshold of bemegride in the rabbit ranges from. 13 to 15 mg./kg. If the animals is given resrpine, conveisions will appear with doses as low 0-7 mg./kg. Methamphetamine, 5-hydroxytryptophan, psilocybin and imipramine protect the reserpinized animal against bexnegriae-induced convulsions.
