T1  - Spatiotemporal brain dynamics of emotional face processing modulations induced by the serotonin 1A/2A receptor agonist psilocybin.
A1  - Bernasconi, Fosco
A1  - Schmidt, Andre
A1  - Pokorny, Thomas
