ID  - 2013-34057-028
DO  - http://dx.doi.org/10.1523/JNEUROSCI.2063-13.2013
T1  - Broadband cortical desynchronization underlies the human psychedelic state.
A1  - Muthukumaraswamy, Suresh D
A1  - Carhart-Harris, Robin L
A1  - Moran, Rosalyn J
