T1  - The NMDA antagonist ketamine and the 5-HT agonist psilocybin produce dissociable effects on structural encoding of emotional face expressions.
T3  - Psychopharmacologia
A1  - Schmidt, Andre
A1  - Kometer, Michael
A1  - Bachmann, Rosilla
