T1  - Hypermetabolic pattern in frontal cortex and other brain regions in unmedicated schizophrenia patients: Results from a FDG-PET study.
T3  - Archiv fur Psychiatrie und Nervenkrankheiten, European Archives of Psychiatry & Neurological Sciences
A1  - Soyka, M
A1  - Koch, W
A1  - Moller, H. J
