T1  - Psilocybin impairs high-level but not low-level motion perception.
T3  - Neuroreport: An International Journal for the Rapid Communication of Research in Neuroscience
A1  - Carter, Olivia L
A1  - Pettigrew, John D
A1  - Burr, David C
A1  - Alais, David
